{"parentUuid":"0a3d9d6f-8b24-4e12-9ffc-3ff77f8c56cb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"effeb2d1-329d-425b-9549-b5199a46d687","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WBKPzTtM9hBfuDPHWcRp16","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"COR-2052\",\"uuid\":\"b38a2c22-0830-4230-a381-fe680949eb9b\",\"title\":\"Remove Graph from Brain’s memory workflow\",\"description\":\"Brain simplification 2/12. Incrementally evolve the existing Brain after the initial local-to-hosted path works end to end; preserve working behavior and existing data during migration.\\n\\nMake memory installation, extraction, and retrieval work independently of Graph.\\n\\nAcceptance criteria:\\n\\n* Remove Graph as a required installation/setup dependency for memory use.\\n* Stop memory processing from triggering semantic code/entity indexing, structural analysis, or unrelated refreshes.\\n* Verify the complete memory workflow with Graph absent.\\n* Preserve existing memory data and clearly handle any retained opt-in structural features.\",\"projectMilestone\":{\"id\":\"b3b9c5e4-e502-4b63-9f45-382109d35556\",\"name\":\"Post launch\"},\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/issue/COR-2052/remove-graph-from-brains-memory-workflow\",\"gitBranchName\":\"suhaan/cor-2052-remove-graph-from-brains-memory-workflow\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-08T18:15:28.873Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-14T04:08:53.623Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"6170bf77-16d7-4d42-9fe6-e0090e8536a0\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-08T18:15:28.873Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Evis Drenova\",\"createdById\