{"parentUuid":"ffbd2aab-e2cc-4325-b826-e48d085b9943","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14996532 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fe44544e-0962-44b7-af17-4c32c1ae350c","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:25:02.106Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14996532 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"fe44544e-0962-44b7-af17-4c32c1ae350c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01WLnHbQEg2gkXWroCn2r7Fh","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f49f9c16-9498-4394-ac46-367db5e832c7","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:25:22.051Z","session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"f49f9c16-9498-4394-ac46-367db5e832c7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgAFUVvoVytBiLrC5AVbR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Everything you shipped in Entire\n\n## 26 open PRs on `entire-brain` — all green, none merged\n\n**First-run truth (the \"healthy repo reports itself broken\" class)**\n- **#373** stop reporting a repo with no captured sessions as broken\n- **#345** say what's true on a first run\n- **#342** make the brain discoverable, remember what the user declined\n- **#346** stop our own installers blocking our own install\n- **#321** configurable distill timeout + name the nested-repo trap\n\n**Everything printed must be runnable**\n- **#341** doctor prints only what a reader can act on\n- **#347** make printed advice runnable, name the escape hatch\n- **#348** render remedies in the reader's own dispatch spelling\n- **#349** three remedies the reader couldn't follow\n- **#372** summarise the provider failure instead of dumping the host CLI's help\n- **#343** say why a memory prepass failed, stop retrying what can't change\n- **#344** say what sharing a brain costs, at the moment it costs it\n\n**Setup redesign** (17 lines → ~5)\n- **#374** seven-phase progress UI, capability block, distill consent gate\n- **#401** short form by default, phase view behind `--verbose`\n\n**MCP surface**\n- **#397** add `brain_recall` + a guard against losing a tool again\n- **#400** hide six compatibility aliases from the advertised surface\n- **#402** warn when the install runs from a directory the system may delete\n\n**Semantic / manifest**\n- **#395** ingest provider schema 1.3, say why a snapshot has no identity\n- **#398** a writer refusing an unknown field isn't corruption\n- **#399** let a recorded component failure age out once it rebuilds\n- **#329** retrieval returns output an agent can accept, discloses what was dropped\n\n**Release & CI**\n- **#350** changelog since 0.1.0 **+ all 24 PRs integrated**, CI green\n- **#396** settle the pre-push gate, name the two env-only failures\n- **#352** give the test suite a deadline above its own runtime\n- **#351** bound the ollama envelope guard by the client, not the writer\n- **#340** superseded by main — now `+0/-0`, ready to close\n\n## Linear: P0 · GA the Local Brain\n\n- **22 GA issues (M1–M5):** 2 Done, and every remaining one has a PR except **COR-2161** (BrainMark harness, deliberately held)\n- **20 Post-launch**, incl. the 11-step \"Brain simplification\" epic — step 1/12 built, 9/12 Done, 2–8 & 10–12 untouched\n- **COR-2145 / COR-2164** security advisories — assessed and written up today; neither exploitable, and the real finding is that **no GitHub Action is SHA-pinned**\n\n## Defects the work surfaced that nothing else would have\n\n- **Ten cross-PR defects** found only by building the integration branch — each PR green alone, broken together. Including **#329 un-retiring the exact field #398's test used as \"retired\"**, and `hookStdinWouldBlock` checking the *process* where its comment claimed the *reader* — the actual hang.\n- **Eleven more** invisible to a local run, because CI shards `internal/cli` eight ways and those tests only passed when a sibling in the same binary set their env. Six were real — including **`--backfill` silently doing nothing**.\n- **The released brain can't record a memory** — proven in a clean room: a fresh README install exposes 36 MCP tools with `brain_remember` absent.\n- **The doctor's install-durability check was dead on Windows** — every root a POSIX path, so a plugin in `%TEMP%` reported \"durable\".\n\n## Still yours\n\n- Approve & merge — **#395 before #329**\n- Close **#340** (empty diff)\n- Reinstall `entire` — your binary is the Aug 19 build, which is why `trail finding resolve` 404s"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_read_input_tokens":883008,"output_tokens":1305,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1305,"cache_read_input_tokens":883008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1273},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2a58d898-5710-40fb-8903-05fc9bd77e04","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgAFUVPpBroLwghqVjLrk","requestRef":"b7b9bc3e-a2cb-4f7f-92ed-b0d25aa92eb6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"dee13ce0-7956-420b-92f9-fc5c482d7112","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:25:22.046Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
