{"parentUuid":"18180b00-55fd-4f6e-b0ca-de5fb957dd78","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14995264 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5593fc79-b6c4-4d53-a90c-381c99ee1307","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:27:30.019Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14995264 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"5593fc79-b6c4-4d53-a90c-381c99ee1307","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_014zF3tyV69C3Xp6bgGHNN37","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9710b738-84b2-4bc1-82e6-92369513af4e","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:27:50.066Z","session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"9710b738-84b2-4bc1-82e6-92369513af4e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgAFfQJXURo4XLcNmPGb8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Your impact across Entire — 200 PRs, 10 repos\n\n## entire-graph — the code graph *(56 PRs, 39 merged)*\n- **Landed the launch stack** (#346) — the reviewed `#297`+`#298–#314` chain onto main\n- **Made search trustworthy:** exact corpus-wide IDF (#292), declaration-aware output (#315/#316/#317), preserved identity and caps under tight budgets (#295/#296/#297), agent byte budgets on replay (#282)\n- **Killed three hangs:** multi-pattern `git grep` (#298), Go router-group fixed point on `labstack/echo` (#305), and output that silently **depended on measured latency** (#301)\n- **Stopped the graph lying:** ambiguous local calls no longer claimed exact (#280), every relation labelled `EXTRACTED`/`INFERRED`/`AMBIGUOUS` (#264), phantom class members across Python/Swift/Kotlin/Rust/PHP (#262/#270)\n- **~2.9× cheaper per query** via `--format agent` in the guide (#275), plus cache reuse across worktrees and clones (#323)\n- **Shipped the Claude Code prompt-time graph hook** (#320) and subagent registration (#322)\n\n## entire-brain — the local brain *(44 PRs, 26 open and green)*\n- Built the **first-run experience**: seven-phase setup UI with a **consent gate before spending tokens** (#374), then cut it to a 5-line short form (#401)\n- Made **everything printed runnable** — six PRs turning diagnostics into commands a reader can actually type\n- Added **`brain_recall` to MCP** (#397) and hid six fake aliases (#400)\n- **Proved the released brain cannot record a memory** — clean-room install, 36 tools, `brain_remember` absent\n- **Integrated all 24 PRs** (#350) and found **ten cross-PR defects** no single PR's CI could see\n\n## graphmark — the benchmark harness *(51 PRs, 18 merged)*\n- Published the **official SWE-bench Multilingual 300 suite** with cross-model results and a REPRODUCE guide (#52)\n- **Audited your own harness and disclosed against yourself** (#49, #55) — fairness repairs, leak scan, the VERIFY damage mechanism (#61)\n- Established the honest number: **+8.6% token savings**, after withdrawing inflated headlines\n\n## entire-judge — the integrity lens *(all 5 merged)*\n- Built the **dishonesty detector**: flags unaddressed AI warnings (#2)\n- Scored **Entire CLI awareness** per team with exported feedback (#3, #5)\n\n## entire-api / entire.io / entiredb\n- **Cost analytics**: trust CLI-reported cost, fall back to server estimate (#576)\n- **brainstore** — server-side brain artifact store (#164), and you **reverted it yourself** when it wasn't ready (#166)\n- **Agent-provenance experts endpoint** (#126)\n- **Externalized transcript images render in the viewer** (#2746), hardened after review (#2789)\n- **Trail line counts now match Git's own diff** (entiredb #3319)\n\n## The throughline\n- You repeatedly **found the defect in your own instrument before shipping its result** — retracting the 6,900× ingest claim, the +5.33 LoCoMo win, and inflated savings headlines\n- You built the habit that catches them: **weaken the guard, prove the test goes red** — which caught 8 of 15 unheld guards in one sweep\n- Two security advisories assessed today; the real finding was **no GitHub Action is SHA-pinned**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1180,"cache_read_input_tokens":890632,"output_tokens":1245,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1180,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":890632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1180,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral