{"parentUuid":"6d066097-9add-4609-84c5-943838e2cbe6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8315b60b-aefd-4ed3-8412-df471c2c27c7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FGsMMfMtXWZExFXfFaaBif","type":"tool_result","content":"O2499  fix(agent): make installed external agents visible and removable\nO2498  fix(cli): show checkpoint ID in `checkpoint list --pending`; disambiguate `session info` checkpoint labels\nO2497  fix(investigate): degrade --edit gracefully without a TTY\nO2496  fix(setup): don't fail `entire enable` on the telemetry prompt without a TTY\nO2303  fix: detect empty-tree commits and stop condensing over them\nO2302  feat: differentiated per-hook timeouts, replacing the flat 30s cap\nO2301  feat: support a generic git provider for --checkpoint-remote\nO2300  feat: surface progress during the OPF re-redaction phase of checkpoint sync\nO2299  feat: discover untracked OpenCode sessions on entire session attach\nO2298  fix: fall back to reasoningText in the compacted Copilot transcript builder\nO2297  fix: correlate Claude Code SubagentStop on agent_id, not tool_use_id\nO2296  fix: fall back to transformedContent/reasoningText when Copilot CLI content is empty\nO2295  fix: give each Pi subagent run a unique session identifier\nO2294  fix: warn visibly when an agent commits with no active session recorded\nO2293  fix: qualify \"no checkpoints found\" when the scan limit truncated\nO2292  fix: point investigate/review error hints at entire agent add\nM2291  perf: reduce transcript and repeated-secret scan allocations\nO2234  fix: don't let a tool call's own payload spoof the image-object redaction skip\nM2233  fix: warn on every entire investigate run that agent sandboxing is off\nM2232  fix: serialize session-state clear against concurrent MutateSessionState\nM2231  fix: stop entire investigate fix from following an untrusted file path\nM2230  fix: require the worktree-suffixed shadow-branch shape for unattended deletion\nO2229  fix: cap local git-blob reads on checkpoint trees\nM2228  fix: don't let findInaccessiblePlugin re-find a binary via a relative PATH entry\nM2227  docs: disclose that pasted images bypass all redaction\nO2226  fix: serialize shadow-branch migration against concurrent checkpoint writes\nM2225  fix: verify cross-repo checkpoint response identity before rendering\nM2224  fix: refuse cross-host redirects in OAuth token-exchange POST\nM2174  test(checkpoint): pin the shadow-branch worktree hash to known-answer vectors\nM2173  fix(auth): keep auth-go's process lock out of the real user cache under test\nM2172  test(e2e): fail the canary when no agent registered instead of skipping everything\nM2171  test(strategy): isolate hooks_test git commands from the developer's global config\nM2170  test(gemini): pin GetProjectHash to known-answer vectors\nM2169  test(summarize): stop the nil-generator test launching the real claude CLI\nO2168  fix(trailers): stop untrusted commit subjects from forging Entire trailers\nO2167  fix(checkpoint): never store a shadow checkpoint with a transcript chunk hole\nO2074  Add cross-repository context sharing to the CLI\nC2071  fix(textutil): strip Cursor transcript <timestamp> wrappers from prompts\nO2070  fix(codex): map last_assistant_message onto Event.TaskDescription\nO2069  fix(checkpoint): externalize images in subagent transcripts before size cap\nO2068  fix(claude-code): attribute parallel subagent TodoWrite checkpoints via agent_id\nO2067  fix(cursor): correlate subagentStop without subagent_id via task description\nO2066  fix(redact): preserve Codex input_image payloads during JSONL redaction\nO2041  Record changed code entities in checkpoint metadata (gated, off by default)\nM1888  fix(checkpoint): fall back to v1-branch store when no checkpoint remote is configured\n=== count ===\nCLOSED:10  MERGED:30  OPEN:32","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"859fe478-e312-4bbc-a757-8e46f0be6e5c","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:28:47.849Z","toolUseResult":{