{"parentUuid":"5a82b9a3-ab4e-4967-b218-b5e957eccdd8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgAFmnsWCCBxRtQ94x3Ru","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":895144,"output_tokens":1738,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":943},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1738,"cache_read_input_tokens":895144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13745,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"39835a6f-72ac-41a5-84d7-af0faf45254e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgAFmnSiLDZWBo9kWrz25","requestRef":"73578181-857b-4749-a328-197e6d5cbaba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b8678f47-6a0e-4a3d-800e-6472916e890f","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:29:13.738Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"b8678f47-6a0e-4a3d-800e-6472916e890f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgAFmnsWCCBxRtQ94x3Ru","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Your 7\n\n- **You made `entire blame` and `entire why`** — line-level attribution for AI work. Point at any line and get the agent session that wrote it and *why it exists*, with an interactive viewer and an honest tag legend. The thing `git blame` can't answer once an agent is in the loop.\n\n- **You made `entire-graph`** — the deterministic local code graph behind search, impact and neighbors. In a **preregistered study, n=200 across 5 real repos, it beat strong grep on locate 79 vs 52 at a 4 KiB budget (p=0.0045)** — and you shipped the launch stack after fixing three hangs it exposed, including an infinite loop on `labstack/echo` that had been there since v0.1.0.\n\n- **You made `entire-brain`** — durable, branch-scoped, provenance-anchored memory with a local MCP surface. Setup went from 17 lines of machine detail to a 5-line answer with a **consent gate before it spends a token**. Then you proved the *released* build couldn't record a memory at all — clean-room install, 36 tools, `brain_remember` missing.\n\n- **You made `entire-judge`** — the integrity lens. It flags AI warnings a team left unaddressed and scores how well each team actually used Entire, with per-team feedback exported. A dishonesty detector pointed at your own users' workflow.\n\n- **You made `entire experts`** — ranks agent provenance across a code scope, routed to the repo's own jurisdiction cell with an identity token. Answers \"who — or what — actually knows this code\".\n\n- **You made `graphmark` and the official SWE-bench Multilingual 300 suite** — cross-model results with a REPRODUCE guide. Then you **audited your own harness and published against yourself**: the honest number is **+8.6%**, after you withdrew the inflated headlines and found the fairness bugs that produced them.\n\n- **You hardened the CLI nobody else was looking at** — ~30 merged security and correctness fixes: credential-bearing POSTs following cross-host redirects, untrusted commit subjects forging Entire trailers, `investigate fix` following untrusted paths, shadow-branch races, transcript chunk holes. Several were in every released tag.\n\nOne flag: I can stand behind every number above. I didn't verify the \"200k+ stars\" figure — tell me the repo set you mean and I'll confirm it before you put it in a deck."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":895144,"output_tokens":1738,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":943},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1738,"cache_read_input_tokens":895144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"39835a6f-72ac-41a5-84d7-af0faf45254e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgAFmnSiLDZWBo9kWrz25","requestRef":"73578181-857b-4749-a328-197e6d5cbaba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a03bea8-e00f-429f-8154-8d8930bd4d5c","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:29:25.155Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-rebase","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
