selected winners median 109pt; simulate the null first\n- [Mechanism endpoint caught a false headline](mechanism-endpoint-caught-a-false-headline.md) — score rose but mechanism metric ROSE too = baseline drift; pre-register mechanism as PRIMARY\n- [Estimator flips the sign](estimator-flips-the-sign.md) — pooled +8.73% vs equal-weighted −3.02%; nine loss-tail predictors dead\n- [Per-loser forensics doctrine](per-loser-forensics-doctrine.md) — investigate each loser; fix the defect CLASS; re-verify winners\n- [Benchmark arm-fairness bugs](benchmark-arm-fairness-bugs.md) — audit the HARNESS before the tool; verify.run was eg-only in all 5 cells\n- [Load pressure is an arm confound](load-pressure-is-an-arm-confound.md) — starvation inflates whichever arm runs under it, flips sign; cap ~8-way/48GB\n- [eg A/B cache trap](eg-ab-testing-cache-trap.md) — index cache tree-keyed not binary-keyed; separate --cache-dir per build\n- [eg nested worktrees kill cache](eg-nested-worktrees-kill-cache.md) — .claude/worktrees/* blows 64-path digest budget; ~5s per search uncached\n- [Stale baseline contamination](stale-baseline-contamination.md) — Haiku/Sonnet baselines predate env-repair clamp; diff prompts line-by-line\n- [VERIFY command fails fairness](verify-command-fails-fairness.md) — a runnable test command is arm-asymmetric HELP not tool output; keep it out of eg tool block\n- [claude --safe-mode strips MCP](claude-safe-mode-strips-mcp.md) — silently removes ALL MCP servers; only check = ask model its tools\n- [Usage is NOT the lever](usage-is-not-the-lever.md) — more graph calls = WORSE (corr −0.166); call count is a difficulty signal\n- [Agentic token saving is the clamp](agentic-token-saving-is-the-clamp.md) — CAUSAL: frugality prompt not graph; unclamped −25.8%→−0.9%\n- [Graph savings scale with session length](graph-savings-scale-with-session-length.md) — saves by deleting locate turns; short-session tiers unreachable\n\n- [Paired deltas decay with n](paired-deltas-decay-wi