ll\n345\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(setup,status): say what is true on a first run\n344\tOPEN\t2026-10-16\tfix(bundle): say what sharing a brain costs, at the moment it costs it\n343\tOPEN\t2026-10-12\tfix(memory): say why a prepass failed, and stop retrying what cannot change\n342\tOPEN\t2026-10-12\tfix(setup): make the brain discoverable, and remember what the user declined\n341\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(doctor): print only what a reader can act on\n340\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(connect): fail loudly when hosted binding cannot be resolved\n330\tMERGED\t2026-10-11\tfix(safety): stop brain colliding with concurrent git, stalling on a dirty tree, and ignoring local models\n329\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(retrieval): return output an agent can accept, and disclose what was dropped\n321\tOPEN\t2026-10-16\tfix(setup): make the distill timeout configurable and name the nested-repo trap","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b9ec2679-5aea-4ea1-a267-20b59da39409","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:12:58.951Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"402\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfeat(doctor): warn when the install runs from a directory the system may delete\n401\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfeat(setup): short-form output by default, phase view behind --verbose\n400\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfeat(mcp): hide six compatibility aliases from the advertised surface\n399\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(status): let a recorded component failure age out once it rebuilds\n398\tOPEN\t2026-10-17\tfix(manifest): a writer refusing an unknown field is not corruption, so stop saying so\n397\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfeat(mcp): add brain_recall, and a guard against losing a tool again\n396\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tdocs(contributing): settle the pre-push gate, and name the two env-only failures\n395\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfix(semantic): ingest provider schema 1.3 in full, and say why a snapshot has no identity\n374\tOPEN\t2026-10-18\tfeat(setup): seven-phase progress UI, capability block, and distill consent\n373\tOPEN\t2026-10-15\tfix(firstrun): stop reporting a repo with no captured s