{"parentUuid":"372662d1-aa1c-49d4-8f6d-c49a5ce12a19","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01VAW2uMPmWG89yGNu74GaQH","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"52575554-d57b-46bb-b4ba-72be0886cec7","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:25:00.771Z","session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-locus-anchors","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"52575554-d57b-46bb-b4ba-72be0886cec7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgBfpGQKptooJ4qBTb1cf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012ahrstBtqqsnF4AgvZ1PPg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A && git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nfix(facts): stop the locus extractor cutting paths at hyphens and dots\n\nA fact about `website/scripts/pre-build.ts` was anchored to two tokens that\nname nothing: \"website/scripts/pre\" and \"build.ts\". The path itself never\nappeared. Quoting it in backticks did not help — the backtick span added the\ncorrect token, but the regex sweep still produced the fragments beside it,\nwhich is what the reporter saw after re-recording the fact.\n\nTwo separate cuts in locusIdentifierPattern, same class:\n\n  - No \"-\" in any segment class, so a segment ended at the first hyphen and\n    the remainder restarted as a new token. .github/workflows/*, pre-build.ts\n    and 20260320-no-raft.md are not exotic names here.\n  - No leading \".\", and add() trimmed the cutset from BOTH ends, so\n    \".github/workflows/ci.yml\" was recorded as \"github/workflows/ci.yml\".\n\nA fragment is worse than a missing anchor. It looks like a path, so it binds\nthe fact to a file that does not exist, and factLocusDrift cannot flag it:\n\"website/scripts/pre\" has no extension and \"build.ts\" has no slash, so neither\nreaches the stat. A hyphenated file could be deleted and no fact about it\nwould ever be reported as drifted.\n\nSegments are now `[A-Za-z0-9_]+(?:-[A-Za-z0-9_]+)*`: the hyphen must be\ninterior, so a trailing dash stays out of the token, and the first alternative\nstill requires a \".\" or \"/\", which is what keeps ordinary hyphenated English\n(\"state-of-the-art\") out of the locus. add() trims leading and trailing\npunctuation separately, keeping a leading dot.\n\nStored facts self-heal: `reclassify` already rewrites Locus when it differs\nfrom what the text derives, so the fragments go away on the next pass without\na migration.\n\nVerified by weakening: dropping the hyphen groups, the leading dot, or the\nasymmetric trim each turns the new tests red; all three restored, green.\nFull internal/cli suite green (211s).\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":157368,"output_tokens":847,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":847,"cache_read_input_tokens":157368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_012ahrstBtqqsnF4AgvZ1PPg":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-locus-anchors && git add -A && git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nfix(facts): stop the locus extractor cutting paths at hyphens and dots\n\nA fact about `website/scripts/pre-build.ts` was anchored to two tokens that\nname nothing: \"website/scripts/pre\" and \"build.ts\". The path itself never\nappeared. Quoting it in backticks did not help — the backtick span added the\ncorrect token, but the regex sweep still produced the fragments beside it,\nwhich is what the reporter saw after re-recording the fact.\n\nTwo separate cuts in locusIdentifierPattern, same class:\n\n  - No \"-\" in any segment class, so a segment ended at the first hyphen and\n    the remainder restarted as a new token. .github/workflows/*, pre-build.ts\n    and 20260320-no-raft.md are not exotic names here.\n  - No leading \".\", and add() trimmed the cutset from BOTH ends, so\n    \".github/workflows/ci.yml\" was recorded as \"github/workflows/ci.yml\".\n\nA fragment is worse than a missing anchor. It looks like a path, so it binds\nthe fact to a file that does not exist, and factLocusDrift cannot flag it:\n\"website/scripts/pre\" has no extension and \"build.ts\" has no slash, so neither\nreaches the stat. A hyphenated file could be deleted and no fact about it\nwould ever be reported as drifted.\n\nSegments are now `[A-Za-z0-9_]+(?:-[A-Za-z0-9_]+)*`: the hyphen must be\ninterior, so a trailing dash stays out of the token, and the first alternative\nstill requires a \".\" or \"/\", which is what keeps ordinary hyphenated English\n(\"state-of-the-art\") out of the locus. add() trims leading and trailing\npunctuation separately, keeping a leading dot.\n\nStored facts self-heal: `reclassify` already rewrites Locus when it differs\nfrom what the text derives, so the fragments go away on the next pass without\na migration.\n\nVerified by weakening: dropping the hyphen groups, the leading dot, or the\nasymmetric trim each turns the new tests red; all three restored, green.\nFull internal/cli suite green (211s).\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the fix"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_012ahrstBtqqsnF4AgvZ1PPg":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-locus-anchors"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"02231661-52ca-49a7-8e81-8045e2c35c25","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBfpFyWy73DYxT9Dwmma","requestRef":"ea0e0dd1-f68c-4757-9de9-6f53db432cd9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"9db1cfcb-88b4-4eaa-9469-bf5dd50388d3","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:25:00.770Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-locus-anchors","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
